  "analysis": "We have 6fps prompt OCR data and a grouping file, but the displayed output was mostly from the partial dense OCR grep. I need inspect /app/prompt6_groups.txt directly to see the candidate commands extracted from the higher fps prompt crops. This is the key data for reconstructing the move list.",
  "plan": "Display /app/prompt6_groups.txt in chunks with line numbers. Then run a condensed parser that outputs only the candidate commands one per line for easier review and comparison.",
  "commands": [
